CHAPTER.VERS:
And Isaiah said to them, Thus you

          {+}
         will say to your

          {+}
         master, Thus says Yahweh, Don't be afraid of the words that you have heard, with which the attendants of the king of Assyria have blasphemed me.

Thus you

          {+}
         will speak to Hezekiah king of Judah, saying, Don't let your God in whom you trust deceive you, saying, Jerusalem will not be given into the hand of the king of Assyria.

And this will be the sign to you: You

          {+}
         will eat this year that which grows of itself, and in the second year that which springs of the same; and in the third year you

          {+}
         will sow, and reap, and plant vineyards, and eat their fruit.
